ort ) -  O<br>Object interact - F and Mouse left click<br><br>More about system you can find in the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy SimulDrone</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892500/extras/c789d301d3bb2f404622f103e3090542.avif?t=1703116051\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892500/extras/c0aaeb8e09d0e7f7eafc0dc6eba48cda.avif?t=1703116051\" /></div>",
